ep Dogs Out of My Yard? 7 Proven Deterrents</h2></a><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] line-clamp-2 flex-1\">Learn how to keep dogs out of your yard using motion-activated sprinklers, L-footer fencing, and safe repellents to stop digging and urine burns.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[var(--color-muted-fg)]\"><span>David Park</span><time dateTime=\"2026-08-25 02:15:52\">Aug 25, 2026</time></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex flex-col bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><a class=\"block relative aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden bg-[var(--color-muted)]\" href=\"/blog/get-rid-crane-flies-leatherjacket-larvae-control\"><img alt=\"How Do You Get Rid of Crane Flies? Targeting Lawn-Damaging Larvae\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/Ab5bfb03b2d294bc6805c49e78e8b8f2bt.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"p-4 flex flex-col flex-1\"><a class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)] uppercase tracking-wide mb-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/categories/home-garden\">Home &amp; Garden</a><a href=\"/blog/get-rid-crane-flies-leatherjacket-larvae-control\"><h2 class=\"font-bold text-base leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors line-clamp-2\">How Do You Get Rid of Crane Flies? Targeting Lawn-Damaging Larvae</h2></a><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] line-clamp-2 flex-1\">Learn how do you get rid of crane flies by targeting root-eating leatherjacket larvae with nematodes, soap flushes, and targeted lawn defense.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[var(--color-muted-fg)]\"><span>Lisa Thompson</span><time dateTime=\"2026-08-25 02:15:52\">Aug 25, 2026</time></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex flex-col bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><a class=\"block relative aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden bg-[var(--color-muted)]\" href=\"/blog/yard-steps-pace-counting-fertilizer-coverage\"><img alt=\"How Many Steps in a Yard to Calculate Fertilizer Coverage and Costs\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/A1555a15c9b224df0b70632c82bc2c054f.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"p-4 flex flex-col flex-1\"><a class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)] uppercase tracking-wide mb-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/categories/home-garden\">Home &amp; Garden</a><a href=\"/blog/yard-steps-pace-counting-fertilizer-coverage\"><h2 class=\"font-bold text-base leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors line-clamp-2\">How Many Steps in a Yard to Calculate Fertilizer Coverage and Costs</h2></a><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] line-clamp-2 flex-1\">Learn how many steps in a yard translate to square footage for precise fertilizer dosage, product coverage costs, and hardscape stair budgeting.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[var(--color-muted-fg)]\"><span>Sarah Chen</span><time dateTime=\"2026-08-25 02:15:52\">Aug 25, 2026</time></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex flex-col bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><a class=\"block relative aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden bg-[var(--color-muted)]\" href=\"/blog/gallons-in-cubic-yard-dosage-guide\"><img alt=\"How Many Gallons Are in a Yard? Soil &amp; Liquid Dosage Guide\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" clas