s, and bulk vs. bagged cost comparisons.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[var(--color-muted-fg)]\"><span>Robert Hayes</span><time dateTime=\"2026-08-25 02:15:52\">Aug 25, 2026</time></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex flex-col bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><a class=\"block relative aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden bg-[var(--color-muted)]\" href=\"/blog/centimeters-to-yard-lawn-coverage-cost-guide\"><img alt=\"How Many Centimeters is a Yard? Lawn Coverage &amp; Material Cost Guide\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/Aeeb39d313a0c4883acc4443e6b4683899.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"p-4 flex flex-col flex-1\"><a class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)] uppercase tracking-wide mb-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/categories/home-garden\">Home &amp; Garden</a><a href=\"/blog/centimeters-to-yard-lawn-coverage-cost-guide\"><h2 class=\"font-bold text-base leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors line-clamp-2\">How Many Centimeters is a Yard? Lawn Coverage &amp; Material Cost Guide</h2></a><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] line-clamp-2 flex-1\">Learn how many centimeters is a yard and master square yard conversions for accurate mulch, soil, and seed coverage calculations and cost estimates.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[var(--color-muted-fg)]\"><span>David Park</span><time dateTime=\"2026-08-25 02:15:52\">Aug 25, 2026</time></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex flex-col bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><a class=\"block relative aspect-[16/9] over